{
  "$schema": "https://developer.microsoft.com/json-schemas/fabric/item/report/definition/visualContainer/2.12.0/schema.json",
  "name": "dbef2afc6a7d68a30d0f",
  "position": {
    "x": 40,
    "y": 216.16702355460393,
    "z": 37250,
    "height": 755,
    "width": 737,
    "tabOrder": 10000
  },
  "visual": {
    "visualType": "textbox",
    "objects": {
      "general": [
        {
          "properties": {
            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "About this page · What to do",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "18pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "What this page is for",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "14pt",
                      "color": "#9cbce8"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The proposal on the table was a blanket 6 % across the LATAM hub: $5.40M, of which 95 % would land on people already paid at or above their band minimum, leaving 23 people in LATAM still below it.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "This page proposes $1.15M instead, on two segments, against the $5.76M of attrition exposure those segments currently carry. It pays for itself in under five months on the segment that drives it.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Three findings, three different levers. That is the whole argument. A pay adjustment, an equity correction and an organisational change are not interchangeable, and a page that listed them as one column of costs would lose the only distinction that matters. Singapore carries $2.18M of exposure and appears here with no cost at all — its compa-ratio is 1.01 and its span of control is 15.1 against a company mean of 6.7. Buying that problem a salary budget would be spending money on the wrong diagnosis.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "São Paulo is on this page because it is not on the list. On base salary it is the most under-paid population in the company. On total target cash it sits at market, and its attrition is inside the noise. An analysis that only showed what fired could not demonstrate that it avoided the expensive mistake.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The figures on this page",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "14pt",
                      "color": "#9cbce8"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Recommended Spend USD",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "What it costs to lift every segment where the pay or the equity rule fired to the selected compa-ratio target. Scoped by which rule fired, not by which city, so it follows the rule rather than a hard-coded list.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Cost to Target Compa-Ratio",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Not the cost of reaching band minimum. Band minimum sits at 80 % of midpoint throughout this survey, so lifting Bogotá Data & Analytics to its floor costs $35K and leaves the segment at 0.85. Lifting it to 0.95 costs $811K. Only the second is the action being recommended.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Payback Months at Target",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Months for the adjustment to be recovered from attrition it avoids. Blank where attrition already sits at or below the baseline: Dublin was caught before attrition reacted, and inventing a payback there would be inventing a benefit.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Attrition Exposure USD",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Twelve months of the current attrition rate, valued at each leaver's salary times the cost of replacing them.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Compa-Ratio Target",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The one assumption on this page a reader can move. It changes what the recommendation costs; it does not change which segments are recommended.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Three assumptions, stated",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "14pt",
                      "color": "#9cbce8"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The replacement factor. 0.5× salary for Operations through 2.0× for managers. HR literature puts the range at 0.5–2×, these figures are widely cited and rarely audited, and every payback on this page moves with them.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The 0.95 target. A choice, not a finding. Below the company mean of 0.98, because the recommendation is to close a gap rather than to overtake the market.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The payback is the optimistic case. It assumes the adjustment brings the segment's attrition all the way down to the company baseline. Pay is one of several reasons people leave; a partial recovery lengthens the payback proportionally.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
